[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.86]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.94]I never got their name until the credits
[00:15.94]now it plays here every single day
[00:19.96]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:24.26]One note at a time
[00:30.06]from people passing through
[00:34.48]a name beside a line
[00:40.22]and part of it is you
[00:51.64]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
